  "bodyHash": "2419a90d094704ea",
  "content": "\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">Create 0.5.1 現已支援 Minecraft 1.18.2 與 1.20.1</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">我們開發的以 Create、Steam Powered 和 Immersive Engineering 為核心的模組整合包，現已上架 CurseForge！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">點擊 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-winter-rescue\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Winter Rescue</a> 進入這款極寒蒸汽龐克生存世界。截圖：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/405/504/unknown_2021.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"265\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/405/502/hud.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"309\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">當然，您也可以單獨遊玩 Steam Powered！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/496/steam-powered-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">Create: Steam Powered</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">將 Create 模組擴展至蒸汽時代</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/636/2021-10-25_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1440\" height=\"811\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">前言：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">受 Create 中熔爐引擎的啟發，我們決定打造更寫實且酷炫的內容。本模組的核心理念是提供更「寫實」的發電方式與機器／構建物，以達成此目標。即使在使用創造模式時，本模組也完全可玩，因為其中包含許多裝飾性方塊，例如金屬齒輪。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">本模組需要 Create 和 Flywheel 作為必要依賴。Immersive Engineering 為選填依賴，用於為本模組提供鋼鐵素材。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">新增內容：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">三種類型的蒸汽引擎：青銅、鑄鐵與鋼製</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">三種類型的飛輪：青銅、鑄鐵與鋼製</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">三種類型的小齒輪與大齒輪：青銅、鑄鐵與鋼製</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">蒸汽流體：設計時充分考慮相容性！註冊於 forge:steam 標籤的其他模組蒸汽流體也能正常運作！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">三種類型的燃燒室：青銅、鑄鐵與鋼製</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">三種類型的蒸汽鍋爐：青銅、鑄鐵與鋼製</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">蒸汽引擎輸出、蒸汽消耗量、齒輪應力影響、發電機輸出與輸入皆可完全自訂設定</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">即將推出的功能：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蒸汽外殼風扇</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">巨型齒輪（例如 3x3 或 5x5 尺寸）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">多區塊鍋爐與發電機組</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">蒸汽飛艇</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">蒸汽噴射背包</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">選填功能：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據 RPM 轉速產生 FE 能量的發電機。可提供紅石訊號以鎖定其運作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">（特別感謝 MRH0 提供的能量轉換程式碼）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/847/2021-10-26_01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"781\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC&amp;A</a> 是一款優秀的模組，強烈建議您搭配 Steam Powered 使用。它為模組整合包提供了許多實用的工具。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">我將發電機加入模組的唯一原因，是希望那些只想體驗 Create 蒸汽動力部分的玩家，能僅憑原版 Create 與 Steam Powered 即可遊玩。這部分是因為 CC&amp;A 擁有很多額外功能，某些使用者可能認為不需要將其納入自己的整合包中。為了改善現況，</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">我新增了一個設定選項，預設會停用我的發電機，讓使用者自行決定要使用哪一款。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">開放原始碼：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">本模組為免費開放原始碼軟體，採用 GNU GPL 3.0 授權條款。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">歡迎您為此專案貢獻力量。請前往 Discord 或 GitHub 儲存庫。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">Discord：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">加入 Discord 以獲得獨家更新預覽與新專案通知</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BWn6E94\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/BWn6E94</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">支持開發者：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">如果您喜愛我們的創作，請支持我們，讓我們能持續開發更多內容</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TeamMoegProjects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/TeamMoegProjects</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持並與我們聯繫</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BWn6E94\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/712310451408470098/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>支持我們，讓我們能持續創造更多內容！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TeamMoegProjects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fteammoeg\" rel=\"nofollow\">愛發電</a></p>\n<p>您的名字將出現在我們的網站上，並獲得 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/BWn6E94\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 中的專屬身分組。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finfo.teammoeg.com%252fsupportlist.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">支持者名單</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finfo.teammoeg.com%252fsupportlistgold.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">黃金支持者名單</a></p>\n<p>除了 Discord，歡迎前往我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforum.teammoeg.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">TeamMoeg 論壇</a>。</p>",
